  "body": "<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>This report aims to:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>inform policy analysis supporting the design of hydrogen transport and storage business models</li>\n  <li>act as a baseline for understanding first-of-a-kind (<abbr title=\"first-of-a-kind\">FOAK</abbr>) project costs for proposed transport and storage projects, as well as hydrogen production projects that include plans for limited transport and storage solutions</li>\n  <li>provide relative hydrogen transport and storage costs for comparison to alternative energy vectors</li>\n  <li>inform assumptions and inputs into energy system modelling to analyse strategic energy decisions</li>\n  <li>inform impact assessments and monitoring and evaluation of future hydrogen projects</li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>",
